mkdir a new dir which is like.. rootA_domain
cd root_domain
now make a device link to the disk( physical disk ) where your A-Root
is sitting.
eg., cd /etc/fdmns;mkdir rootA_domain;cd rootA_domain;ln -s
/dev/dsk/rz8a rootA

now make a new mount point on the root or anywhere..
mkdir /rootA
mount rootA_domain#rootA /rootA

